INSERT INTO `privacy_policies` VALUES (1,'Information We Collect','<p>Updated 14.01.2025</p><p><br></p><p>We collect the following types of information when you visit or use our site:</p><p><br></p><p>Personal Information: This includes your name, email address, phone number, shipping and billing addresses, and payment details.</p><p>Order Information: Details of the products you purchase, including order history.</p><p>Usage Data: We collect information about your interactions with our website, such as IP addresses, browser type, and access times, to improve the user experience.</p><p>Cookies and Tracking Technologies: We use cookies to personalize your shopping experience, analyze website performance, and for advertising purposes.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:55:30','2026-01-14 13:05:53'),(2,'How We Use Your Information','<p>We use the information we collect in the following ways:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>To Process Orders: We use your personal and payment information to process and deliver your orders.</p><p>To Communicate: We may use your contact information to send you updates on your order, marketing emails, and respond to your inquiries.</p><p>To Improve Our Services: We analyze usage data to enhance website functionality, improve customer experience, and provide relevant product recommendations.</p><p>To Comply with Legal Obligations: We may use your information to comply with applicable laws and regulations.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:56:46','2026-01-07 09:56:46'),(3,'How We Protect Your Information','<p>We take reasonable precautions and follow industry best practices to protect your personal information:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We use secure encryption methods (e.g., SSL) to safeguard sensitive data like payment details.</p><p>We limit access to your personal data to authorized personnel only.</p><p>While we strive to protect your data, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee its absolute security.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:57:12','2026-01-07 09:57:12'),(4,'Sharing Your Information','<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your data in the following cases:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Service Providers: We may share your information with third-party service providers who help us run our business (e.g., payment processors, shipping companies).</p><p>Legal Compliance: We may disclose your information if required by law, or if we believe such action is necessary to protect our rights, safety, or the safety of others.</p><p>Business Transfers: In the event of a merger, acquisition, or sale of our business, your information may be transferred as part of the business assets.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:57:24','2026-01-07 09:57:24'),(5,'Your Rights','<p>You have the following rights regarding your personal information:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Access and Update: You can review and update your personal information by logging into your account.</p><p>Opt-Out: You can opt-out of receiving marketing communications by following the unsubscribe instructions in our emails.</p><p>Request Deletion: You may request the deletion of your personal information by contacting us, subject to legal and operational requirements.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:57:36','2026-01-07 09:57:36'),(6,'Cookies and Tracking Technologies','<p>We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience. You can manage your cookie preferences through your browser settings. Note that disabling cookies may limit your ability to use certain features on our site.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:57:48','2026-01-07 09:57:48'),(7,'Third-Party Links','<p>Our website may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those sites. We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing them with any personal information.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:57:58','2026-01-07 09:57:58'),(8,'Children’s Privacy','<p>Our website is not intended for use by children under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us, and we will take steps to delete such information.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:58:10','2026-01-07 09:58:10'),(9,'Changes to This Policy','<p>We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page, and the “Last Updated” date will be revised. Your continued use of our website after any changes signifies your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:58:20','2026-01-07 09:58:20'),(10,'Contact Us','<p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us:</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Email: info@waltzify.com</p><p>Phone: 07314245858; 9522582422</p><p>Mailing Address: Waltzer India,Main Gate, 1A-Balaji Market, Hawa Bangala Rd, near R.R. Cat, opp. Hari Dham Mandir, Indore, Madhya Pradesh 452009</p>',1,'2026-01-07 09:58:56','2026-01-07 09:58:56');
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `privacy_policies` ENABLE KEYS */;
