INSERT INTO `products` VALUES (3,'EFFICACY Steel Toe Cap Safety Shoe Guard with Elastic Bend, Universal Steel Toe Leather Overshoes Workplace Cover with Adjustable Strap, Unisex Safety Footwear Toe Leather (1 Pair) Black','<ol><li>Material - Leather | Sole - Rubber | Toe - Steel Toe.</li><li>SIZE ADJUSTABLE - Shoe caps with adjustable elastic strap, free size. The elastic band can effectively fix the shoes, the back pad width is 2.3\'\', make sure it won\'t fall off during wearing, safe and comfortable.</li><li>WEAR-RESISTANT RUBBER SOLE - The sole thickness is 0.14\'\', clear texture design, the bottom of the special lines with the improved design anti-slip formula, make anti-slip effect was significantly ascension. The stable grip on the ground, anti-wear, non-slip, and high-temperature resistance. Durable, and comfortable to wear.</li><li>Wear Your Own Comfortable Shoes And Have Steel Toe Protection, Practical Easy To Use And Store In A Small Space, Ergonomic, And Hygienic. Fits Over Most Round-Toed Shoes And Closed-Toe High Heels.</li><li>EASY TO USE - Stretch leather overshoes with steel toe for protecting the toe area from accidental crushing or stubbing. The safety steel toe overshoes are non-conductive for heat and electricity. Resistant to slag, acid, alkalis, fuel oil, and high and low temperatures. Sold in pairs and suitable for most safety shoes and boots with laces, secured using the laces (included) or straps of the footwear you are wearing and transferable between users and footwear.</li></ol>','<p>EFFICACY Safety Shoe For Great For Visitors, Clients, Management, Office Workers, Salespeople, Casual And Temporary Workers. Made For Men And Women Easy On/Off Design.</p>','safety shoe toe cap steel toe toe guard for shoes safety steel toe cap for shoes steel toe shoes safety toe safety toe cap steel toe cover steel toe cap toe guard for shoes safety toe guard for shoes','Efficacy',7,1,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-06 12:35:04','2026-01-22 08:44:00',0.00,18.00),(4,'S Hook Safety Chain 6mm Black and Yellow Color ','<ol><li>BRAND – Efficacy, MATERIAL – PVC , COLOR – Black &amp; Yellow.</li><li>HIGH-VISIBILITY DESIGN - Black and yellow color combination provides high visibility, ensuring that the safety chain is easily seen in construction zones and on roads.</li><li>S HOOK TYPE CONNECTORS - The chain features S hook type connectors that allow for secure attachment to barrier cones, posts, or other safety equipment.</li><li>CROWD CONTROL - It is suitable for controlling pedestrian or vehicle traffic during events, construction activities, and other situations that require crowd management.</li><li>MULTIPURPOSE USE - This chain is designed for versatile applications, including construction site safety, road traffic management, and crowd control.</li></ol>','<p>Efficacy Barrier Cone PVC Safety Chain is a valuable tool for enhancing safety and organization in construction and road traffic management. Its high-visibility design, easy installation, and durability make it a practical choice for a range of safety and crowd control applications. Whether you\'re a construction professional or responsible for road safety, this safety chain is an asset for maintaining safe and orderly environments.</p>','Safety chain for industrial use Anti-theft safety chain for gates Safety chain for towing Door','Efficacy',7,1,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-07 08:44:01','2026-01-31 06:48:03',0.00,17.97),(11,'Efficacy Parking Safety Corner Guard for Car Protecttion | Bumper Protection Rubber Corner Guard with Yellow Reflective Tapes for High Visibility 80cm | Pillar Corner Guard for Car Protection','<p>Effective Pillar Protection: These guards provide reliable protection for pillars, preventing vehicle collisions and structural damage in parking lots and garages.</p><p>Bumper Protection: Specifically designed to protect car bumpers from accidental collisions with pillars, walls, or other vehicles in parking spaces.</p><p>Reflective Tapes for High Visibility: Equipped with yellow reflective tapes, enhancing visibility during both day and night for increased safety in parking areas.</p><p>Optimal Size (31 inches/80cm): The 31-inch size ensures substantial coverage, effectively safeguarding vehicles against potential impacts.</p><p>Versatile Application: Ideal for use in various parking areas and garages, these guards promote safety and prevent accidents, making them a valuable addition to parking safety equipment.</p>','<p>Efficacy Parking Safety Corner Guard is a versatile and effective solution designed to enhance safety in parking areas by protecting vehicles and structures from accidental impacts.</p>','Parking safety corner guard Car bumper protection guard Rubber corner guard for pillars High-visibility reflective corner guard','Efficacy',7,1,1,1,0,1,1,'2026-01-09 08:35:15','2026-01-29 08:55:16',5.00,18.00),(16,'Efficacy Silica Gel Breather Size 1000 gm Transformer Desiccant Breathers Color Dark Blue to Pink Indicated Made of Full PVC and UV Protected Polycarbonate Tube & Cup','<ul><li>Contains : 1 Piece | Quantity : 1000GM | Full PVC Body.</li><li>The purpose of these silica gel breathers is to absorb the moisture in the air sucked in by the transformer during the breathing process.</li><li>Silica gel breathers are filled with Blue Silica gel (Indicating Type) which has the moisture absorption capacity and signals the saturation degree by changing its color.</li><li>Silica gel in the breather will be blue when installed and they turn to pink color when they absorb moisture which indicates the crystals should be replaced.</li></ul>','<p>Efficacy silica gel breather is a device used to keep moisture out of the oil-filled conservator tank of an electrical transformer. It is essentially a container filled with silica gel Crystal which are a desiccant (drying agent) that can absorb large amounts of moisture from the air.</p>','breather for transformer breather cup of transformer oil breather cup for 3kg transformer breather silica gel silica gel breather 2kg breather silica gel breathers desiccant breather','Efficacy',7,1,1,1,0,1,1,'2026-01-10 10:55:33','2026-01-22 09:09:02',5.00,17.99),(18,'Cat Trap- S/M/L - 1PC','<ul><li>BRAND – Elysian, MATERIAL - GI, SIZE - Large Size - 43\"x16\"x18” Inch, COLOR – Silver, QTY -1Pc</li><li>LIVE ANIMAL TRAP – Cat cage is Designed for humane trapping, this cage allows for the safe capture of animals without causing harm, allowing for their relocation.</li><li>EXTRA LARGE TRIGGER PLATFORM – Cat Trap Equipped with an extra-large trigger platform, increasing the effectiveness of trapping by providing a larger surface area for triggering the trap mechanism.</li><li>STURDY CONSTRUCTION – Animal cage is Made from durable materials, ensuring reliability and longevity even with repeated use.</li><li>VERSATILE – Cat Cage is Suitable for trapping a variety of animals beyond cats, including raccoons, rabbits, possums, skunks, bobcats, and squirrels.</li></ul>','<p>Cat cage is Designed for humane trapping, this cage allows for the safe capture of animals without causing harm, allowing for their relocation.</p>','cat trap feral cat trap cage cat trap cage cat trap cage big size cat trap cage for stray cats feral cat trap cat trap cat trap cage Live Animal Cage Cat trap Cage cat cage Jungli billi ka pinjra Sqiral Trap','Elysian',65,1,1,1,0,1,1,'2026-01-10 11:11:46','2026-03-14 10:10:03',5.00,17.98),(21,'Touch Shine Powder 200GM - (5/10/25PC)','<ul><li>Contains - 1 Pc | Material - Copper Cleaning Powder | Weight - 200 Gram.</li><li>It is not only effective on copper &amp; brass but also on aluminum, iron, silver &amp; steel articles too.</li><li>Touch shine powder is introduced with new attractive packaging than regular one with increased cleaning foaming power which removes oxide layer easily from metal surface gives shine gloss to metal surfaces.</li><li>Its diamond edge cutting property gives fast cleaning effect.</li><li>For instant cleaning/shine completely safe on