, veterinary clinics, and wildlife control agencies.</li></ul>','<p>Efficacy Animal dog catcher pole is a reliable and user-friendly tool. Its simple design makes it durable and easy to use. This pole is great for safely catching and restraining both domestic and wild animals, mainly dogs of all sizes. It can also be used for animals like pigs and reptiles. It has an automatic lock that activates only when fixed in place. Made from high-quality stainless steel, this pole is also lightweight and easy to carry.</p>','animal catcher wild animal catcher animal control pole catch pole for cats animal control catch pole animal control rod best animal catch pole','Efficacy',73,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-13 09:28:02','2026-03-13 08:45:37',0.00,0.00),(29,'Yellow Leather Apron Size (35 x 24) Inch - (1/3/5PC)','<ul><li>BRAND NAME – Efficacy | MATERIAL – Leather | SIZE – Free Size | STYLE – Heavy Duty</li><li>PREMIUM LEATHER - Efficacy Leather Surface (Which Made for Carefully Selected High Quality Leather for Long Time Durability and Heat &amp; Fire Resistant. DOUBLE STITCHING For Extremely Durability and Comfort.</li><li>SAFETY PROTECTIVE SKIN AND CLOTHING - Breathable Back Leather Welding Apron Can Effectively Protect the Front Part of The Body, Prevent Welding Spatter from Splashing on Clothes and Skin, And Protect Your Safety During the Welding Process. And the Back Is Breathable, It Will Not Feel Too Hot, Making Your Work Easy and Not Tired.</li><li>STRONG TOUGHNESS - Wear Resistance &amp; Heat Resistance &amp; Safe Welding &amp; Flame-Resistant the Work Apron Has Good Softness, Strong Toughness, And Has the Advantages of Wear Resistance, Heat Resistance, Flame-Resistant and Safe Welding. It Is Made of Heat-Resistant Aramid Yarn. The Material Is Durable and Can Provide Maximum Strength.</li><li>VINTAGE LOOK - Adjustable Leather Strap, Lightweight &amp; Classy, Suitable for Uniform Craft Workshop Etc,100% Handmade And Bio Degradable Product 100% Pure Leather &amp; Not Easy to Wrinkle &amp; Adjustable Size &amp; Unisex Adjustable Bbq Apron Made of Pure Leather, Strong Toughness, Not Easy to Wrinkle, And You Can Adjust the Size of The Apron According to Your Needs. Suitable for Both Men and Women.</li></ul>','<p>Efficacy Leather Apron is designed to provide reliable protection and comfort for both men and women during various work activities. Made from this quality, heat-resistant leather, this apron ensures safety while performing tasks like welding, and other heat-intensive jobs.&nbsp;</p>','leather apron leather apron welding leather apron weld leather apron bbq Leather Apron Adjustable Men Wear-Resistant Thicken Heat-Resistant Working Electric Welding Safety Clothing Protective Anti-scalding Yellow','Efficacy',70,1,1,0,1,1,1,'2026-01-13 09:39:39','2026-03-25 11:26:15',0.00,18.00),(36,'Mini Folding Bag Blue Color - (1/3/5PC)','<ul><li>DURABLE MATERIAL – Portable Folding Bag made from high-quality synthetic fabric that is resistant to wear and tear. Ensures long-lasting use even with frequent travel and heavy packing.</li><li>COMPACT AND FOLDABLE – Foldable Bag Easily folds down into a small, compact size for convenient storage when not in use. Perfect for packing as an extra bag for return trips or unexpected purchases.</li><li>SPACIOUS STORAGE - Generous dimensions of 14 x 11.5 x 5 inches offer ample space for clothing, accessories, and other travel essentials.</li><li>VERSATILE USAGE - Can be used as a handbag, suitcase, or storage bag for various needs. Suitable for traveling, storage, shopping and everyday use.</li></ul>','<p>Experience the ultimate convenience in travel and storage with our Synthetic Foldable Bag. Crafted from high-quality synthetic fabric, this versatile bag is designed to withstand the rigors of travel while offering ample space for all your essentials. With its generous dimensions of 14 x 11.5 x 5 inches, this bag is perfect for short trips, weekend getaways, or as an additional storage option.</p>','folding suitcase for travelling carry bag folding synthetic folding suitcase folding bag for travel Multipurpose folding bag foldable bag Synthetic folding bag Foldable travel bag','Elysian',66,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-13 10:42:10','2026-04-09 11:10:51',0.00,17.97),(52,'Activated Charcoal - 100/500/1000GM','<ul><li>ACTIVATED CHARCOAL - This air purifier contains high-quality activated charcoal known for its excellent adsorption properties. It effectively captures and eliminates a wide range of odors and pollutants.</li><li>NATURAL DEODORIZER - The activated charcoal naturally deodorizes the air, making it a suitable choice for eliminating common household odors such as cooking smells, pet odors, and more.</li><li>SAFE AND NON-TOXIC - This product is safe to use and does not emit any harmful chemicals. It\'s an eco-friendly and non-toxic way to improve air quality.</li><li>VERSATILE APPLICATION - The air purifier can be used in various settings, including homes, cars, bathrooms, wardrobes, fridges, shoe racks, and kitchens. It\'s a versatile solution for improving air quality in different areas.</li></ul>','<p>Elysian Barbecue wood coal offers a natural and flavorful way to cook a wide range of dishes in various outdoor and culinary settings. Its versatility, quick ignition, and ability to impart a smoky flavor make it a preferred choice for many grilling and smoking enthusiasts.</p>','Activated Charcoal Litter Fresh Deodorizer Natural Deodorizer 200g Coal For Plants Horticulture Charcoal Activated Charcoal For Car Activated Charcoal Air Purifier','Elysian',65,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-13 11:43:19','2026-02-26 08:15:56',0.00,0.00),(53,'Coconut Coal - 1/3/5/10KG','<ul><li>TASTE THE DIFFERENCE - Earthy &amp; Pleasing Odor Unlike the Machine-Made Coconut-Shell Briquettes. These Charcoals Burn Slower and Cleaner for Three Times as Long Because They Don\'t Include Any Toxic Petroleum Additives. For 45 To 60 Minutes, The Charcoal Will Remain Hot Enough to Burn Incense.</li><li>100% NATURAL - Premium Coconut Shell Coal Is Made by Compressing Only Coconut Shells Without Any Chemical or Toxic Gasses. The Charcoal’s Is Ideal for Burning Dhoop Because It Allows the Heat to Waste Less Spread to All of The Incense\'s Particles. Since It Burns More Cleanly, There Is No Hazardous Smoke, Only the Scent of The Incense Is Released.</li><li>CONSISTENT &amp; EASY BURNING - Pops &amp; Spark Resistant, Uniform &amp; Longer Burning. Burning Dhoop Incense for Your Pujas, Everyday Rituals, Yoga, And Meditation Can Help Purify Your Atmosphere. These Charcoal Briquettes Serve A Variety of Purposes.</li><li>USES - Natural Wood Charcoal for Your Barbecue and Tandoori Nights Barbecue / BBQ / Tandoor / Grill / Sigdi / Gardening Uses / Outdoor Charcoal Etc.</li></ul>','<p>Elysian Coconut Coal Premium Coconut Shell Coal is a high-quality, natural charcoal made from 100% coconut shells, designed for clean, efficient, and long-lasting performance. It burns longer than regular charcoal while producing low smoke and minimal ash, making it ideal for both indoor and outdoor use.</p>','koyla for cooking koyla for cooking 5 kg koyla tandoor Bhatti koyla sigdi koyla sigdi for gas koyla angithi charcoal for barbeque','Elysian',65,1,1,0,1,1,1,'2026-01-13 11:51:54','2026-02-26 08:16:18',0.00,0.00),(54,'Wood Charcoal - 1/2/3/5/10/30','<ul><li>High Heat - Burns at Temperatures High Enough to Grill in That Authentic Barbecue Flavor You Crave.</li><li>Natural Charcoal as it has always been used by our ancestors</li><li>100% Natural No Fillers or Chemicals - Our Barbeque Charcoal and Briquettes Are 100% Natural Hardwood That\'s Never Pressed Like Synthetic Briquettes Giving You A Finished Product of Evenly Grilled Food with A Natural Smoked Taste.</li><li>Clean Burning and Long-Lasting - Lights Quickly, Stays Consistently Hot and Produces Minimal Ash.</li></ul>','<p>Elysian coal are free from impurities and no chemicals are used that could give inadmissible smoke or bad taste to the food. absolutely Dry and has NO Dust/Powder. Ideal for Barbecue, Grill purpose Or to be used in Angeethi.</p>','Barbeque Coal 5kg Coal For Barbeque Grill Coal Bbq Coal 5kg Bio Coal Briquettes Wood Coal For Barbeque Grill Coal For Dhoop wood coal for puja','Elysian',65,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-13 12:04:44','2026-02-26 08:12:27',0.00,0.00),(57,'Safety Chain 6MM','<p>BRAND – Efficacy, MATERIAL – PVC, SIZE – 6mm, COLOR - Red or White, QTY – 50 Meter</p><p>VERSATILITY – Reflective Safety Chain can be easily attached to safety cones, posts, or other barriers.</p><p>LIGHTWEIGHT – Safety Chain is Easy to handle and install, reducing the effort required for setup and removal.</p><p>WEATHER-RESISTANT – Traffic Safety Chain is Designed to withstand harsh outdoor conditions without deteriorating.</p><p>VERSATILE APPLICATIONS – Ideal for No Parking Zones, Road Safety, Barricading Gates, Construction Areas useful in managing crowds and guiding pedestrian flow during events, ensuring orderly movement and safety.</p><p><br></p>','<p>Efficacy PVC Safety Barrier Cone Chain is a versatile and durable solution designed for enhancing safety and managing traffic in various environments. Available in a striking red and white color combination, this chain is ideal for clearly marking boundaries and restricting access to specific areas. The chain comes in a standard length of 10 meters and offers three thickness options: 4mm, 6mm, and 8mm, allowing users to choose the most suitable variant for their needs.</p>','Safety chain for industrial use Anti-theft safety chain for gates Safety chain for towing Door','Efficacy',7,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-14 06:26:39','2026-01-31 06:04:51',0.00,18.00),(59,'Saraswati Kapoor White (500GM)','<ul><li>PREMIUM QUALITY SARASWATI KAPOOR - This product offers high-quality Saraswati Kapoor (camphor), known for its purity and potency in Hindu rituals.</li><li>IDEAL FOR PUJA AND RITUALS - The camphor is perfect for puja and rituals, especially during Saraswati puja and other religious ceremonies.</li><li>PURE AROMATIC EXPERIENCE - The camphor releases a soothing and enchanting aroma that enhances the ambiance of your puja space, promoting a serene and spiritual atmosphere.</li></ul>','<p>Elysian Indian Saraswati kapoor unites spiritual reverence with aromatic essence, creating a blend of devotion and sensory indulgence.</p>','kapoor ki goli for clothes kapoor for bathroom saraswati Kapoor kapoor slab for pooja cloth kapoor goli kapoor for clothes saraswati Kapoor saraswati kapoor 1kg Kapoor for Hawan','Elysian',3,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-01-14 10:42:01','2026-04-09 11:31:55',0.00,4.99),(60,'Farmers Thigh - (5/6/7/8/9/10/11/12SIZE)','<ul><li>SUPERIOR WATERPROOF PROTECTION – Thigh Long Gumboot crafted from quality, durable rubber, these gumboots provide excellent waterproofing to keep feet dry, ideal for heavy rains, wet agricultural fields, or other damp environments.</li><li>ANTI-SLIP SOLE – Thigh Long Gumboot engineered with deep treads and an anti-slip rubber sole, these boots provide stability on wet, muddy, or uneven surfaces, enhancing traction and reducing the risk of slipping.</li><li>CHEMICAL AND ACID RESISTANCE - Thigh Long Boot Specially designed to withstand exposure to certain chemicals, making these boots suitable for environments like liquid chemical factories and other industrial settings.</li><li>VERSATILE APPLICATION - Thigh long Boot Perfect for farmers working in paddy fields, wet soil, or rainy conditions, where waterproof and high-coverage footwear is essential, Chemical &amp; Industrial Settings, Construction Sites or Gardening &amp; Landscaping.</li></ul>','<p>Valorous Thigh Height Long Gumboots are designed with hardworking farmers, agricultural workers, and industrial employees in mind. With an impressive height, these navy blue boots provide superior leg protection from mud, water, chemicals, and debris, keeping you comfortable and safe in various challenging environments.&nbsp;</p>','Full-Length Safety Gumboots Agricultural Wat