erful rust prevention pouch. It creates a long lasting protective barrier to protect any steel, metal or alloy surface against the effects of rust and corrosion. Use it on exposed metal surfaces, including engine components, suspension units.</p>','VCI pouch corrosion protection packaging rust prevention pouch vapor corrosion inhibitor bag metal protection storage pouch industrial rust protection packaging moisture resistant anti corrosion pouch steel iron parts protection','Elysian',67,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-02-10 12:08:54','2026-03-23 05:57:58',0.00,18.00),(384,'Rappelling Gloves - (1PC)','<ul><li>DURABLE - Synthetic leather base layer, durable ,long lasting.</li><li>ANTI-SLIP - Top quality PU reinforcement ensures excellent abrasion resistance and grip.</li><li>DESIGNED FOR - The Army Leather Heli Ski was designed for freeriders, professional mountain guides and patrollers, ski instructors and others who place high demands on function, fit and durability.</li><li>IMPACT PROTECTION – considerate and thoughtful design on details , our slithering gloves will guard your safety on any worksite, from work high above the ground, rescue, Rappelling rope descending , spelunking (cave exploring)</li></ul>','<p>Heavy duty - Made for Rough use and impact protection, considerate and thoughtful design on details , our slithering gloves will guard your safety on any worksite, from work high above the ground, rescue, Rappelling rope descending , spelunking.</p>','rappelling gloves rescue gloves anti slip gloves climbing gloves mountaineering gloves rock climbing gloves tree climbing gloves wall climbing gloves safety gloves grip gloves heavy duty gloves work gloves outdoor gloves industrial safety','Valorous',67,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-02-11 04:44:19','2026-04-11 09:35:25',5.00,18.00),(386,'Aluminum Mosquito Net 3FT - (1/3/5/10/25MTR)','<ul><li>COMPOSITE ALUMINIUM CONSTRUCTION - The Mosquito Net is Made Using a Composite Aluminium Material, Which Combines the Strength and Durability of Alu