s free of moisture Makeup travel bag Foggy windshields To save your cell phone from water damage To help keep photos safe and free from moisture. To keep important documents safe. To use in each container in your basement, garage, or storage unit to absorb excess moisture.</p>','silica gel for moisture silica gel for camera silica gel for camera bags silica gel for clothes silica gel for clothes storage','Elysian',72,0,0,0,1,1,1,'2026-02-19 05:32:21','2026-02-28 11:25:37',2.50,1.00),(439,'Silica Gel - 1GM Pouches Rose Fragrance  (100/250/500/1000/5000 GM)','<p><strong>QUALITY</strong> – Premium quality silica gel crystals infused with a pleasant fragrance for added freshness.</p><p><strong>HIGH ADSORPTION CAPACITY</strong> – These silica gel desiccants are highly active, with excellent moisture-absorbing properties, stable thermal performance, and chemical resistance. They safely absorb moisture without reacting with other materials.</p><p><strong>VERSATILE USE</strong> – Ideal for protecting leather jackets, shoes, boots, photograph albums, electronics, computer media, and other valuable items from dampness.</p><p><strong>EFFECTIVE MOISTURE CONTROL</strong> – Each pouch contains silica gel crystals that efficiently absorb moisture and maintain a dry, de-moist environment wherever placed, keeping your belongings safe and fresh.</p>','<p>Elysian Rose Fragrance Silica Gel Beads are specially designed to control moisture while releasing a pleasant rose aroma. These scented silica gel beads help absorb excess humidity and keep wardrobes, cupboards, drawers, shoe racks, and storage boxes fresh and dry.&nbsp;</p>','fragrance silica gel rose scented silica gel beads rose fragrance moisture absorber scented desiccant beads aroma silica gel moisture control beads rose smell silica gel for cupboard wardrobe drawer shoe rack room freshener silica gel moisture absorber','Elysian',72,0,1,0,0,1,1,'2026-03-13 05:57:11','2026-03-13 06:38:12',0.00,18.00),(440,'Silica Gel - 2GM Pouch